{"id":"3929f56790d04f90","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-external-redex-persistence.md","title":"外部红项收缩前唯一且持续外部","display":"thm-external-redex-persistence — 外部红项收缩前唯一且持续外部","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-external-redex-persistence","aliases":["56-thm-external-redex-persistence"],"display":"thm-external-redex-persistence — 外部红项收缩前唯一且持续外部","depends_on":["[[56-df-external-redex]]","[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.31 and Examples 9.2.32(ii); local persistence consequence","source_printed_pages":"497","source_ocr_blocks":[518],"source_statement_status":"local-consequence-of-source-definition","source_proof_status":"direct-residual-proof-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-external-redex-persistence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-external-redex-persistence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-external-redex-persistence — 外部红项收缩前唯一且持续外部"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11b60d6a0ba187b5\" href=\"?note=11b60d6a0ba187b5\" title=\"56-df-external-redex\">56-df-external-redex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.31 and Examples 9.2.32(ii); local persistence consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"497"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>518</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"local-consequence-of-source-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"direct-residual-proof-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b60d6a0ba187b5\" href=\"?note=11b60d6a0ba187b5\" title=\"56-df-external-redex\">56-df-external-redex</a> 的正交系统与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{External}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{External}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R\\)</span> 与拼接律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a> 及其上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\ne v\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\{u\\}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(t)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\ne v\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\{u\\}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(t)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\{u\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\{u\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow u\\in\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow u\\in\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零步条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 最外，因此不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的收缩不可能在它严格上方。剩下的两类为平行收缩或在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 内部的收缩；正交单步残余公式都恰给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{u\\}\">\\(\\{u\\}\\)</span>。把该步与从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 开始的任意有限路径拼接，原外部性与残余拼接律说明其全部后续残余仍最外，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 外部。若收缩的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，其残余为空且此后保持空。对路径长度归纳得到后两式。</p>\n<p>集合中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 保留相同位置和规则编码，但其周围项与匹配替换可以改变。这不是把收缩后同位置重建的红项当成旧残余：实际收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的分支被明确送到空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-external-redex","status":"resolved","id":"11b60d6a0ba187b5","anchor":"ref-1","